WEBVTT

00:18.880 --> 00:22.145
- Giddy up!
- Giddy up!

00:29.888 --> 00:32.928
- Giddy up!
- Giddy up!

00:55.776 --> 00:57.257
Xiang!

01:00.577 --> 01:01.817
Xiang!

01:01.817 --> 01:03.097
Let go of me!

01:03.097 --> 01:04.936
- You two wenches.
- Let go!

01:04.936 --> 01:06.056
Just yield!

01:08.136 --> 01:11.017
If you run again, I'll kill Xiang!

01:11.017 --> 01:12.216
Ting Hui!

01:12.216 --> 01:13.977
Xiang!

01:26.457 --> 01:28.097
I'll kill you!

03:12.845 --> 03:15.168
[Episode 1]

03:30.816 --> 03:31.816
Giddy up!

03:36.320 --> 03:37.320
Giddy up!

03:44.497 --> 03:46.616
[Shazhou]
Young master, Shazhou ahead.

03:46.616 --> 03:47.977
According to our secret guards,

03:47.977 --> 03:50.696
this strategic military stronghold
is involved in the illegal arms trade.

03:50.696 --> 03:52.616
And Governor Ding Chong is behind it.

03:52.616 --> 03:54.097
He is the prized follower of Lord Xu.

03:54.097 --> 03:56.416
Before the fasting period ends,

03:56.416 --> 03:59.016
we must determine
how involved Xu Ting is in this

03:59.016 --> 04:00.497
and return to the capital with the evidence.

04:00.497 --> 04:01.600
As you command.

04:01.600 --> 04:04.032
- Giddy up!
- Giddy up!

04:04.032 --> 04:05.627
- Giddy up!
- Giddy up!

04:07.136 --> 04:09.181
- Giddy up!
- Giddy up!

04:10.432 --> 04:11.576
Giddy up!

04:11.576 --> 04:12.938
It's Huo An.

04:12.938 --> 04:15.537
It seems Lord Xu doesn't want me,
the emperor, to continue the investigation.

04:15.537 --> 04:18.056
Young master, I'll deal with them.

04:18.056 --> 04:20.056
Stick to the plan. Split up.

04:22.936 --> 04:23.936
Huo An.

04:25.496 --> 04:26.856
You'll have to get past me first.

04:26.856 --> 04:27.856
Charge!

04:30.400 --> 04:32.800
[Shazhou]

04:35.777 --> 04:37.736
Hot steamed buns!

04:39.846 --> 04:42.784
[Shazhou Women's Academy]

04:43.417 --> 04:45.936
Predictions for the women's Provincial Exam.

04:47.056 --> 04:49.936
The only one in all of Shazhou.
First come, first served.

04:50.577 --> 04:53.856
Meng Ting Hui, how much is it this time?

04:53.856 --> 04:55.097
The starting price is 30 taels.

04:55.897 --> 04:57.736
- 30 taels!
- 30 taels!

04:57.736 --> 05:00.936
Last month's academy exam predictions
were only ten taels!

05:00.936 --> 05:02.537
It's for the Provincial Exam this time!

05:02.537 --> 05:04.697
Women haven't been allowed
to take the imperial exam for nine years.

05:04.697 --> 05:06.657
Finally, His Majesty
has reopened the Imperial Exam.

05:06.657 --> 05:08.697
Once you pass, you'll serve His Majesty

05:08.697 --> 05:09.936
and rise to fame and fortune.

05:10.816 --> 05:12.496
It's not even expensive
to sell it at 1,000 taels.

05:12.496 --> 05:16.017
You hit three essay questions
for last month's academy exam.

05:16.017 --> 05:17.137
I'll buy it this time.

05:17.137 --> 05:18.496
I'll pay 35 taels.

05:18.496 --> 05:20.616
Last time, I was at the top of the academy
thanks to her questions.

05:20.616 --> 05:21.736
I'll pay 40 taels.

05:21.736 --> 05:22.897
I'll pay 45 taels.

05:22.897 --> 05:24.737
- 50 taels!
- Sold!

05:24.737 --> 05:25.977
Let me see who dares to buy!

05:27.137 --> 05:28.137
Jiang Mei Er.

05:44.217 --> 05:45.856
- Are you nuts?
- Don't be impulsive.

05:45.856 --> 05:48.977
Listen, last month,
Wen just talked back to her once

05:48.977 --> 05:50.416
and was then expelled from the academy.

05:50.416 --> 05:52.097
My uncle is the Governor of Shazhou.

05:52.777 --> 05:54.577
He funds this academy.

05:55.457 --> 05:56.577
If you offend me,

05:56.577 --> 06:00.017
none of you will have a place in Shazhou.

06:00.017 --> 06:01.856
What does my business have to do with you?

06:01.856 --> 06:06.017
Meng Ting Hui, if it weren't
for you selling predictions every month,

06:06.017 --> 06:07.777
how could I always be last?

06:08.577 --> 06:10.017
You can be a buyer too.

06:10.017 --> 06:11.778
My uncle has ruled

06:11.778 --> 06:14.416
that girls pay 100 taels
to register for the Imperial Exam.

06:15.056 --> 06:16.657
You're just a poor orphaned girl.

06:16.657 --> 06:18.256
You can't marry into a wealthy family

06:18.256 --> 06:19.777
or run a profitable business.

06:20.497 --> 06:23.217
Now you're dreaming of changing your life
through the Imperial Exam.

06:25.137 --> 06:26.697
You wish!

06:26.697 --> 06:27.697
You rely on your family,

06:28.697 --> 06:29.697
and I rely on my ability.

06:30.777 --> 06:33.816
Whether I can do it, let's see on the exam!

06:40.097 --> 06:43.056
[Personal Dossier: identity certificate]
If your dossier gets blown away by the wind,

06:43.056 --> 06:44.736
can you take the imperial exam then?

06:46.256 --> 06:49.457
How dare you! How did you get my dossier?

06:49.457 --> 06:52.056
My uncle is the Governor of Shazhou.

06:52.056 --> 06:54.097
You always talk about your uncle.

06:54.097 --> 06:56.217
You're not tired of saying it,
but we're tired of hearing it.

06:57.616 --> 06:58.736
Stop laughing!

07:00.176 --> 07:03.176
Meng Ting Hui, considering we are classmates,

07:04.097 --> 07:07.176
if you kneel down and sincerely beg me,

07:07.176 --> 07:09.897
I might just be merciful

07:10.577 --> 07:11.897
and return your dossier.

07:11.897 --> 07:13.296
Kneel right away.

07:13.296 --> 07:14.736
Otherwise, you'll miss the chance.

07:18.137 --> 07:20.218
Since you insist, you kneel for me!

07:20.218 --> 07:21.256
How dare you!

07:27.137 --> 07:29.977
Jiang Mei Er, return my dossier!

07:30.616 --> 07:32.337
Shazhou is just a tiny place.

07:32.337 --> 07:34.496
Just wait. You'll be punished by the law.

07:34.496 --> 07:36.777
And I'll tear apart your arrogant faces.

07:42.296 --> 07:43.856
But what can you do to me now?

07:44.816 --> 07:47.296
People are born different from each other.

07:47.296 --> 07:49.416
My uncle holds power in Shazhou.

07:49.416 --> 07:51.017
So, what can you do to me?

07:53.736 --> 07:54.856
I'll fight you with my life!

07:57.137 --> 07:58.816
Meng Ting Hui, you're crazy!

07:58.816 --> 08:01.936
If you don't want your face ruined,
return my dossier!

08:03.097 --> 08:04.176
Return my dossier!

08:04.176 --> 08:06.897
Xia, give it back to her! Hurry!

08:10.817 --> 08:12.856
Meng Ting Hui, you're crazy!

08:12.856 --> 08:14.296
Meng Ting Hui wants to kill me!

08:42.400 --> 08:47.661
[Personal Dossier Holder: Meng Ting Hui]

09:44.337 --> 09:46.097
You two brats!

09:47.537 --> 09:48.537
I raised you,

09:48.537 --> 09:49.577
fed you,

09:49.577 --> 09:50.856
and taught you skills.

09:51.896 --> 09:53.256
Yet you try to run away!

09:53.256 --> 09:55.697
You forced us to steal and cheat.

09:55.697 --> 09:57.297
You never taught us.

09:57.297 --> 09:59.136
You treated us like animals.

09:59.136 --> 10:00.376
You never raised us.

10:12.057 --> 10:16.496
Without me, you would have starved to death.

10:16.496 --> 10:18.536
I'm not afraid of death.

10:18.536 --> 10:20.697
But we want to see you die!

10:20.697 --> 10:22.656
If one day I have a knife in my hand,

10:22.656 --> 10:24.896
I'll cut you into pieces!

10:24.896 --> 10:26.496
Is this how you repay your lifesaver?

10:26.496 --> 10:27.496
You don't deserve my repayment!

10:28.136 --> 10:30.776
You abduct women, traffic children,

10:30.776 --> 10:32.016
and kill at will.

10:32.016 --> 10:34.496
You are a heinous criminal!

10:37.536 --> 10:39.256
I'm a criminal?

10:39.256 --> 10:41.697
Show me your evidence. What charges?

10:41.697 --> 10:43.097
Who will convict me?

10:44.177 --> 10:45.177
Just you?

10:46.177 --> 10:49.698
Who would believe a little beggar like you?

10:49.698 --> 10:53.097
The officials all consider me a good citizen.

10:53.097 --> 10:56.337
But you, a little liar,

10:57.496 --> 10:59.097
want to kill me?

11:00.177 --> 11:01.697
You are

11:03.297 --> 11:05.177
just a murderer!

11:10.977 --> 11:13.537
Meng!

11:13.537 --> 11:15.937
I heard
Jiang Mei Er came picking on you again.

11:15.937 --> 11:17.376
She really thinks we're easy to bully!

11:17.376 --> 11:19.817
I failed the academy exam anyway,
so I'm not afraid of being expelled.

11:19.817 --> 11:24.057
Look, I'll smash her
with my abacus right now.

11:24.697 --> 11:25.697
Come back!

11:27.016 --> 11:28.697
You mustn't do that!

11:28.697 --> 11:31.616
This abacus is what your mother left you.

11:32.217 --> 11:34.217
It's not worth using it to hit her.

11:36.977 --> 11:38.256
Jiang Mei Er did this?

11:38.256 --> 11:40.136
You need to write with this hand!

11:40.136 --> 11:42.417
I'm going to tear her apart right now!

11:42.417 --> 11:43.736
Come back!

11:43.736 --> 11:45.937
How could she get the better of me?

11:50.616 --> 11:52.097
I snatched her dagger

11:52.097 --> 11:54.297
and almost slit her throat.

11:54.297 --> 11:57.577
You didn't see
how she was scared out of her wits

11:57.577 --> 11:59.057
and fled in panic.

12:03.016 --> 12:04.057
Have a seat.

12:22.337 --> 12:23.817
You promised me

12:23.817 --> 12:26.776
you would focus on studying
and not confront her head-on.

12:26.776 --> 12:28.297
I had no choice this time.

12:28.297 --> 12:29.656
She threatened me with my dossier.

12:32.937 --> 12:34.776
Here it is. I snatched it back!

12:38.937 --> 12:40.577
Ever since I met you,

12:42.057 --> 12:46.856
[Shuxiu: students' payment to teachers]
you've been doing odd jobs for your tuition

12:46.856 --> 12:48.376
and studying late into the night.

12:49.698 --> 12:50.698
I know

12:50.698 --> 12:54.337
you've been hoping to take the imperial exam.

12:54.337 --> 12:57.016
But in my opinion,
nothing is worth risking your life.

12:57.697 --> 13:01.536
I might be an orphan girl, but I'm tough.

13:04.457 --> 13:07.457
Anyway, Jiang Mei Er is a vengeful girl.

13:07.457 --> 13:09.217
You can't stay in this dormitory.

13:09.217 --> 13:11.016
Pack your things and stay at my place.

13:24.736 --> 13:25.736
Fu Zhi.

13:29.656 --> 13:30.656
I shouldn't go.

13:32.337 --> 13:34.016
Every time I go to your house,

13:34.016 --> 13:36.297
your stepmother looks at me like I'm a thief.

13:40.097 --> 13:41.817
How about moving to Bofeng?

13:41.817 --> 13:44.937
So, your father and stepmother agreed
to let you run Bofeng?

13:47.497 --> 13:50.577
Father becomes a stepfather
once he remarries.

13:51.417 --> 13:54.736
My stepmother is unhappy
about me failing the academy exam,

13:54.736 --> 13:56.817
so she handed over the dying Bofeng to me.

13:56.817 --> 14:00.016
She even said
if I can't earn 300 taels within a month,

14:00.016 --> 14:01.256
I'll have to obediently get married.

14:04.057 --> 14:07.376
But are women born to be housewives?

14:07.376 --> 14:10.417
I may not be good at studying,
but I'm good with the abacus.

14:10.417 --> 14:11.736
I'm also good at doing business.

14:11.736 --> 14:13.577
Yet they just look down on me.

14:13.577 --> 14:14.577
Fu Zhi.

14:16.057 --> 14:17.536
Let's go make our fortune in the capital.

14:18.896 --> 14:21.177
You open a restaurant,
and I'll pursue an official career.

14:21.896 --> 14:23.457
In the capital,

14:23.457 --> 14:25.417
we will surely make it.

14:27.856 --> 14:29.217
Good idea!

14:30.897 --> 14:33.536
But right now,
they're deliberately forcing me to marry.

14:33.536 --> 14:35.217
It's been bothering me.

14:35.217 --> 14:36.776
I'll help you figure something out.

14:36.776 --> 14:37.776
Really?

14:38.536 --> 14:40.297
Then you save up for the registration fee.

14:40.297 --> 14:41.337
Let's earn money together

14:41.337 --> 14:42.856
and turn the corner.

14:42.856 --> 14:43.856
Sure, let's turn the corner.

14:46.977 --> 14:48.417
Situ Xue.

14:49.057 --> 14:55.656
Situ Xue is here!

15:05.297 --> 15:06.417
Who is Situ Xue?

15:06.417 --> 15:07.856
She is the top dancer in the capital.

15:07.856 --> 15:10.177
Whatever she eats or uses becomes popular.

15:10.177 --> 15:12.736
Yes, His Majesty praised her
when she performed at the Flower Festival.

15:14.376 --> 15:15.496
Situ Xue!

15:15.496 --> 15:17.016
Situ Xue!

15:17.016 --> 15:18.136
Situ Xue!

15:19.297 --> 15:20.297
Situ Xue!

15:22.856 --> 15:27.376
I got it! Situ Xue!

15:30.656 --> 15:31.896
Everyone gets one. Come on.

15:32.937 --> 15:35.656
Today, Situ Xue will dance at Bofeng.

15:35.656 --> 15:39.977
The Spring-Autumn Pastry
made by Miss Situ is 20 percent off.

15:39.977 --> 15:43.177
Everyone, hurry to Bofeng to see Situ Xue!

15:43.177 --> 15:45.097
Situ Xue!

15:47.817 --> 15:51.016
Honored guests, today, Bofeng reopens.

15:51.016 --> 15:54.937
We've specially invited Situ Xue,
the top dancer, to perform here.

15:54.937 --> 15:56.736
Great!

15:56.736 --> 15:58.057
All guests

15:58.057 --> 16:01.136
can watch Miss Situ's dancing up close.

16:01.136 --> 16:02.697
For three days only!

16:02.697 --> 16:04.417
- Great!
- Great!

16:04.417 --> 16:06.817
Please welcome Miss Situ!

16:34.336 --> 16:36.316
[Coffin of Madam Wang, Mother of Feng Lu]

16:44.057 --> 16:46.297
Mr. Feng's mother has passed away.

16:46.297 --> 16:47.776
Voluntary mourning.

16:47.776 --> 16:48.896
Voluntary mourning.

16:51.776 --> 16:52.776
Put it on!

16:57.136 --> 16:59.217
Mr. Feng's mother has passed away.

16:59.217 --> 17:00.457
Voluntary mourning.

17:00.457 --> 17:01.697
Voluntary mourning.

17:07.264 --> 17:09.216
[Memorial Tablet of Madam Wang,
Mother of Feng Lu]

17:09.216 --> 17:13.568
[Feng Lu, Head of the Heihu Crew]

17:27.722 --> 17:29.696
[Wedding Convoy]

17:32.667 --> 17:33.667
[Coffin of Madam Wang, Mother of Feng Lu]

17:58.457 --> 17:59.776
Let's talk this over.

17:59.776 --> 18:00.776
Get down!

18:02.096 --> 18:03.096
Come out!

18:04.056 --> 18:05.496
My dear!

18:05.496 --> 18:06.496
Go away!

18:06.496 --> 18:07.496
My dear!

18:08.977 --> 18:10.576
It's my wedding day.

18:10.576 --> 18:11.977
[Coffin of Madam Wang, Mother of Feng Lu]
How can I wear mourning clothes?

18:14.096 --> 18:15.937
Just shut up!

18:19.096 --> 18:20.217
My dear!

18:21.296 --> 18:22.296
My dear!

18:22.897 --> 18:25.016
My dear!

18:25.016 --> 18:26.816
My dear!

18:26.816 --> 18:28.016
My dear!

18:29.617 --> 18:31.016
My dear!

18:33.897 --> 18:34.897
My dear!

18:35.937 --> 18:36.937
My dear!

18:37.937 --> 18:39.576
My dear!

18:39.576 --> 18:41.056
My dear!

18:57.472 --> 19:00.928
[Bofeng]

19:04.898 --> 19:07.336
Bofeng is finally going to come back to life!

19:07.336 --> 19:10.377
We paid a lot for the camels
and parade float, and it all paid off.

19:14.536 --> 19:15.536
Great!

19:20.256 --> 19:21.792
[Zhang's Lamb Soup]

19:29.377 --> 19:30.897
Today is my mother's funeral.

19:32.697 --> 19:33.697
And yet

19:34.697 --> 19:37.496
someone dares to open for business!

19:37.496 --> 19:38.496
Men!

19:42.496 --> 19:45.056
The Heihu Crew is here! Run!

19:45.897 --> 19:47.377
The Heihu Crew is holding a funeral.

19:47.377 --> 19:48.576
Quick, close the business
and send the guests away.

19:55.137 --> 19:56.977
Mr. Feng's mother has passed away.

19:56.977 --> 19:59.776
Yet you're dressed so gaudily,
deliberately going against the Heihu Crew!

19:59.776 --> 20:00.776
Please calm down.

20:01.576 --> 20:04.857
We'll change into mourning clothes right away

20:04.857 --> 20:05.857
to express our condolences.

20:07.898 --> 20:10.137
You've offended the old madam's death day!

20:10.137 --> 20:12.537
We'll turn your celebration into a funeral!

20:12.537 --> 20:14.016
I am the boss of Bofeng.

20:14.016 --> 20:15.377
She is just my honored guest.

20:15.377 --> 20:16.697
If you have any issues, come at me!

20:16.697 --> 20:17.857
I'll grant your wish!

20:25.296 --> 20:26.296
Playing the hero?

20:27.137 --> 20:28.977
Guess who stands behind the Heihu Crew?

20:28.977 --> 20:31.816
Governor Ding Chong, the ruler of Shazhou!

20:33.056 --> 20:35.457
They have many people and power.
We can't afford to offend them.

20:41.096 --> 20:43.657
Don't worry. You don't need to fear them.

20:43.657 --> 20:45.496
Very bold of you, young master.

20:45.496 --> 20:47.977
It's fine if you're not afraid,
but don't drag Bofeng into this.

20:59.697 --> 21:01.016
How dare you!

21:10.857 --> 21:12.256
Local military weapon?

21:12.256 --> 21:13.736
How do you have a military knife?

21:13.736 --> 21:14.816
If you like it, I'll give it to you.

21:19.617 --> 21:23.177
This person arrogantly provokes you,
but he has nothing to do with Bofeng.

21:26.336 --> 21:27.336
Fu Zhi.

21:33.296 --> 21:34.296
Meng.

21:34.296 --> 21:36.256
We already offended them on opening day.

21:36.256 --> 21:37.776
What will happen to future business?

21:37.776 --> 21:38.858
Don't worry.

21:38.858 --> 21:41.457
The guy out there is fighting them.

21:41.457 --> 21:44.736
He doesn't look like a local,
so maybe he can handle it.

21:44.736 --> 21:47.056
Fu Zhi, you leave through the back door
and go home.

21:47.056 --> 21:48.256
Take a break for now.

21:48.256 --> 21:50.296
No, you did this to help me.

21:50.296 --> 21:51.617
How could I abandon you?

21:51.617 --> 21:54.056
They don't even know what I look like.

21:54.056 --> 21:56.496
If your father hears about today from others,

21:56.496 --> 21:57.697
he will blame you.

21:57.697 --> 21:59.177
You'd better go home now and explain to him

21:59.177 --> 22:01.137
in case your stepmother
makes a fuss about it.

22:03.217 --> 22:04.457
You hide on the second floor.

22:04.457 --> 22:05.576
I'll come find you tomorrow.

22:05.576 --> 22:07.137
- Okay.
- Okay.

22:46.377 --> 22:48.977
Young master,
we've closed the business for today.

22:48.977 --> 22:50.177
Please leave.

22:53.937 --> 22:55.256
You've trespassed into a woman's room.

22:55.256 --> 22:57.536
If you don't leave now, I'll call for help.

22:58.417 --> 22:59.417
Go.

23:03.736 --> 23:05.256
Where did you get this dagger?

23:07.016 --> 23:08.016
I picked it up on the road.

23:11.137 --> 23:13.576
It's specially made by the Shazhou Armory.

23:13.576 --> 23:14.977
You sure picked up good stuff.

23:15.657 --> 23:17.857
I'm just a commoner.

23:17.857 --> 23:19.897
How would I recognize such military items?

23:19.897 --> 23:21.776
But how come you are so familiar with it?

23:22.417 --> 23:23.736
Could you be a deserter?

23:23.736 --> 23:25.697
Are the people out there hunting you?

23:25.697 --> 23:28.977
Just now, you used me to get away.

23:28.977 --> 23:31.496
How could you repay kindness with enmity?

23:31.496 --> 23:34.617
Please leave immediately,
and don't pester me anymore.

23:35.377 --> 23:38.217
You impersonated Situ Xue
to deceive the people.

23:38.217 --> 23:40.576
You hold a military weapon
with ill intentions.

23:40.576 --> 23:42.137
By law, you should be exiled.

23:42.137 --> 23:43.617
What makes you say I'm fake?

23:53.256 --> 23:56.897
That's because I met the real Situ Xue once.

23:59.177 --> 24:00.177
Help!

24:18.736 --> 24:19.736
Stop!

24:21.217 --> 24:22.217
Did you sleep well?

24:24.217 --> 24:25.496
Return my dossier.

24:25.496 --> 24:26.496
Where did the weapon come from?

24:28.576 --> 24:29.816
It's from Jiang Mei Er.

24:29.816 --> 24:31.017
Go on.

24:31.017 --> 24:33.377
Her uncle is Ding Chong,
the Governor of Shazhou.

24:34.296 --> 24:37.056
I accidentally took it
during a fight with her at the academy.

24:37.056 --> 24:39.536
The Heihu Crew acts lawlessly in Shazhou.

24:39.536 --> 24:42.857
And Ding Chong sit secure
on his position as Governor of Shazhou.

24:42.857 --> 24:44.617
The Heihu Crew acts as his henchmen.

24:46.056 --> 24:48.336
For years,
they've seized fertile land for him,

24:48.336 --> 24:50.256
forced women into prostitution,
and murdered merchants.

24:50.256 --> 24:52.217
Their crimes are numerous.

24:52.217 --> 24:53.657
Shazhou borders Beijian.

24:54.377 --> 24:57.496
It's a strategic military location,
but it's far from the emperor's reach.

24:57.496 --> 25:00.336
With the garrison stationed here,
no one manages Shazhou's affairs.

25:00.336 --> 25:03.576
In Shazhou, Ding Chong is the emperor.

25:05.536 --> 25:06.857
Is there a black market in Shazhou?

25:07.816 --> 25:09.897
In Jiuyou City,
you can buy all kinds of forbidden goods.

25:09.897 --> 25:12.897
As long as you can afford the price,
there's nothing they dare not sell.

25:12.897 --> 25:14.256
Where is it?

25:14.256 --> 25:18.496
Go south three li from Bofeng,
and you'll see a poplar forest.

25:18.496 --> 25:21.056
Then follow the riverbed east, and you'll...

25:22.937 --> 25:27.016
Young master, the local terrain is complex.

25:27.016 --> 25:30.056
Release me, and I'll draw you a detailed map.

25:33.137 --> 25:37.377
In that case,
I'll trouble you to lead the way personally.

25:37.377 --> 25:39.457
Even if I'm to lead the way,
you have to release me first.

25:41.096 --> 25:43.937
After all, I'm just a weak woman.

25:43.937 --> 25:45.857
Don't play tricks.

25:45.857 --> 25:47.737
Until I find out the truth about the weapon,

25:47.737 --> 25:48.977
you can't go anywhere.

25:50.536 --> 25:52.496
We're going to Jiuyou City now.

25:52.496 --> 25:53.816
It's too late.

25:54.576 --> 25:57.178
Jiuyou City opens at the hour of You
and closes at the hour of Zi.

25:57.178 --> 25:58.256
We'll have to wait until tomorrow night.

25:59.576 --> 26:02.496
You are selfish and full of lies.

26:02.496 --> 26:04.496
After being exposed, you tried to quibble.

26:04.496 --> 26:06.697
You can easily play innocent and pitiful.

26:06.697 --> 26:09.177
So you're quite cunning,
deceitful, and two-faced.

26:09.177 --> 26:10.977
How do I know you're not lying to me?

26:13.816 --> 26:16.217
You really have a deep impression of me.

26:19.937 --> 26:21.657
I can take you
to the entrance of Jiuyou City.

26:22.736 --> 26:24.457
But please allow me
to leave immediately afterwards.

26:24.457 --> 26:26.177
Fu Zhi's restaurant just opened.

26:26.177 --> 26:27.377
I also need to prepare for the imperial exam.

26:28.016 --> 26:31.457
We just want to find a way to survive.

26:31.457 --> 26:33.336
We don't dare
go to the terrifying Jiuyou City,

26:33.937 --> 26:35.857
let alone get involved
with weapons and Ding Chong.

26:36.657 --> 26:38.336
That sounds more believable.

26:39.776 --> 26:41.776
You were so anxious about this dossier.

26:42.857 --> 26:44.417
Are you trying to become an official?

26:45.217 --> 26:46.217
None of your business!

26:47.496 --> 26:48.657
That's the only path

26:50.417 --> 26:51.496
I can take.

26:56.217 --> 26:57.776
[Tomb of Xiang]
Xiang.

26:57.776 --> 27:02.177
From now on, I'm alone. What should I do?

27:02.897 --> 27:04.177
Xiang

27:05.177 --> 27:07.816
would surely want you to live on bravely.

27:09.217 --> 27:11.177
I want to avenge Xiang's death!

27:13.897 --> 27:17.857
I'll make those villains suffer
a million times more than her!

27:17.857 --> 27:21.496
Hatred only blinds people,

27:22.217 --> 27:23.617
making them unable to see the path ahead.

27:24.296 --> 27:28.096
There are many ways to seek justice.

27:33.977 --> 27:37.536
Becoming strong is the best way
to take revenge.

27:37.536 --> 27:40.056
How can I become as strong as you?

27:40.056 --> 27:42.576
Go study, pass the imperial exam,

27:42.576 --> 27:44.096
and become an official.

27:44.096 --> 27:47.296
When you hold power,
everything will be different.

27:53.536 --> 27:55.536
The women's imperial exam
has been suspended three times.

27:55.536 --> 27:57.016
This year,
the Imperial Exam is held for the first time.

27:58.256 --> 28:00.937
But the court demands 100 taels
for its registration.

28:01.617 --> 28:04.657
Many local women are deterred by the money.

28:06.256 --> 28:08.617
I still haven't saved enough money.

28:08.617 --> 28:11.256
Only by becoming an official
can one have power.

28:11.256 --> 28:13.457
This dossier is my life.

28:13.457 --> 28:14.457
Absurd!

28:15.177 --> 28:16.978
The court never charged registration fees.

28:16.978 --> 28:20.056
In Shazhou,
Ding Chong's rules are the court's rules.

28:20.056 --> 28:21.296
The imperial exam is imminent.

28:21.296 --> 28:23.256
I'm just protecting myself.
What's wrong with that?

28:23.256 --> 28:26.217
Sounds reasonable and convincing.

28:27.217 --> 28:29.776
However, it's hard to tell if you're lying.

28:29.776 --> 28:33.377
I'll return your dossier
once we reach Jiuyou City.

28:37.496 --> 28:44.417
<i>♪ Please drink one more cup of wine ♪</i>

28:44.417 --> 28:53.056
[Ding Chong, Governor of Shazhou]
<i>♪ No old friends outside the pass ♪</i>

28:53.056 --> 28:54.056
Mr. Ding.

28:55.336 --> 28:59.536
Your sister, Mrs. Jiang,
has sent the profit share and the guest list.

29:00.137 --> 29:02.137
Here are also the accounts of Jiuyou City.

29:02.137 --> 29:04.576
His black market business
is a capital offense.

29:04.576 --> 29:07.697
Tell Feng Lu to sell secretly next time

29:07.697 --> 29:10.617
and have his minions keep a low profile.

29:10.617 --> 29:12.137
It's too conspicuous.

29:12.137 --> 29:15.977
Mr. Feng has you as his backer,
so he's grown ever more bold.

29:15.977 --> 29:17.937
Today, his mother passed away.

29:17.937 --> 29:20.496
They even forced people to wear mourning.

29:20.496 --> 29:22.576
They not only hacked a groom to death,

29:22.576 --> 29:24.177
but also injured many people.

29:24.897 --> 29:27.377
That idiot always causes trouble for me!

29:28.617 --> 29:30.377
Mr. Feng knows he's troubling you,

29:32.256 --> 29:35.417
so he decided to give you more.

29:35.417 --> 29:37.056
That's considerate.

29:39.840 --> 29:41.657
[Guest List of the Silver House]

29:41.657 --> 29:44.776
Uncle!

29:45.657 --> 29:46.857
Be careful.

29:46.857 --> 29:50.296
Uncle, did Yan Fu Zhi give you any money
when she opened her restaurant?

29:50.897 --> 29:52.096
What money?

29:52.096 --> 29:53.096
Sir,

29:53.776 --> 29:57.776
Miss Yan took over Bofeng
and reopened it today.

29:57.776 --> 30:01.977
She invited Situ Xue from the Huiyin House
in the capital to build up hype.

30:01.977 --> 30:07.377
It's said she is the top dancer there
and a peerless beauty.

30:08.217 --> 30:10.897
Tell me, who is more beautiful,
me or Situ Xue?

30:10.897 --> 30:12.576
Of course, Situ Xue.

30:14.617 --> 30:15.617
No, you're more beautiful,

30:15.617 --> 30:16.816
radiant, and charming.

30:16.816 --> 30:19.096
Situ Xue is just a performer.

30:19.096 --> 30:20.937
How can she compare to you?

30:22.816 --> 30:24.256
Uncle.

30:24.897 --> 30:27.617
Yan Fu Zhi doesn't take you seriously.

30:28.296 --> 30:30.336
She didn't even invite you to her opening.

30:30.336 --> 30:32.937
And she even helped Meng Ting Hui fight me.

30:32.937 --> 30:34.137
Uncle, look!

30:34.137 --> 30:36.256
Meng Ting Hui even hurt my neck.

30:36.256 --> 30:38.217
They almost killed me!

30:38.937 --> 30:41.377
So Uncle, you must teach them a lesson.

30:41.377 --> 30:42.377
Last time in the academy exam,

30:42.377 --> 30:44.657
because Meng Ting Hui
sold the exam questions in advance,

30:44.657 --> 30:45.937
I ended up with the lowest rank.

30:47.377 --> 30:48.857
Don't you feel embarrassed?

30:48.857 --> 30:52.217
Without me, you wouldn't
even have made the bottom of the list.

30:52.217 --> 30:56.377
I've already paved the path
for your exam in the capital.

30:56.377 --> 30:58.897
But you still have to study,
even just for show.

30:58.897 --> 31:00.457
That's the important thing.

31:00.457 --> 31:02.657
Don't keep fighting against an orphan girl.

31:02.657 --> 31:04.217
Got it, Uncle.

31:04.217 --> 31:07.296
And I'll arrange a decent, easy job

31:07.296 --> 31:10.417
for you then.

31:10.417 --> 31:11.697
Will you take it?

31:11.697 --> 31:13.657
Of course, thank you, Uncle!

31:13.657 --> 31:15.138
I knew you are the best

31:15.138 --> 31:16.697
and would definitely have my back.

31:16.697 --> 31:17.697
Wait.

31:17.697 --> 31:19.977
Isn't this jewelry from last month?

31:19.977 --> 31:21.897
Come on.

31:21.897 --> 31:24.177
Take this and buy new jewelry.

31:24.177 --> 31:25.857
Thank you, Uncle. I'll go now.

31:25.857 --> 31:28.417
Study hard, and don't end up last again!

31:28.417 --> 31:29.417
Got it.

31:30.177 --> 31:32.536
She is kind of goofy,

31:32.536 --> 31:34.217
just like her short-lived father.

31:34.217 --> 31:36.617
She has a pretty face but no brains.

31:37.977 --> 31:42.217
By the way, has the registration fee
for the Imperial Examination been collected?

32:00.320 --> 32:03.040
[Xu Ting, Left Chancellor]

32:18.617 --> 32:19.657
Lord Xu.

32:19.657 --> 32:22.816
It's already very late,
but you're still working.

32:23.536 --> 32:27.697
And our new emperor used his seclusion
to sneak out of the palace.

32:27.697 --> 32:29.096
It's quite inappropriate.

32:30.336 --> 32:35.937
[Memorial from Magistrate Wang Song Ping]
Young people enjoy traveling.

32:35.937 --> 32:37.256
But I never thought

32:37.256 --> 32:41.217
[Memorial from Minister Wan Kai]
he'd allow women to take the imperial exam.

32:41.977 --> 32:45.496
He didn't learn enough lessons
from the previous abolition of women's exams.

32:46.377 --> 32:47.617
Women can't be involved in politics,

32:47.617 --> 32:50.217
or the state will surely be in a crisis.

32:50.217 --> 32:53.937
Their political participation
is absolutely unacceptable.

32:53.937 --> 32:55.096
I agree, my lord.

32:56.296 --> 33:00.457
Women may not even have read
The Nine Chapters on the Mathematical Art.

33:00.457 --> 33:02.536
How can they involve themselves
in state affairs?

33:02.536 --> 33:03.657
As for His Majesty,

33:05.016 --> 33:09.736
under the pretext of seclusion,
he secretly visited Shazhou.

33:10.857 --> 33:15.496
Did he act on impulse?
Or is he up to something?

33:25.177 --> 33:27.232
Anyway, he's still too young.

33:28.672 --> 33:29.776
No need to worry.

33:30.736 --> 33:35.496
I've had Huo An go to Shazhou
and bring His Majesty back.

33:35.496 --> 33:38.697
Otherwise, on the day of emergence,

33:38.697 --> 33:42.736
our national dignity will be endangered.

33:55.137 --> 33:58.056
Meng, wake up quickly!

33:58.056 --> 33:59.256
Meng, get dressed right now!

33:59.256 --> 34:02.256
Many guests have come, all here for Situ Xue.

34:02.256 --> 34:03.736
We're going to be rich!

34:03.736 --> 34:06.496
Meng, you really are my lucky star!

34:08.737 --> 34:12.417
You audacious lecher,
how dare you barge into Meng's room!

34:12.417 --> 34:14.937
Meng, did he touch you?

34:15.656 --> 34:17.096
Are you okay?

34:17.096 --> 34:18.096
Fu Zhi.

34:19.338 --> 34:21.696
You lecher, I'll kill you right now!

34:23.897 --> 34:25.096
I'll chop you to pieces!

34:27.257 --> 34:28.417
As expected of this place.

34:29.536 --> 34:31.176
The locals are indeed fierce.

34:33.536 --> 34:36.377
You mean I'm fierce? Prepare to die!

34:38.576 --> 34:40.857
Fu Zhi, he didn't take liberties with me.

34:40.857 --> 34:41.857
Then who is he?

34:41.857 --> 34:44.176
Why is he in your room early in the morning?

34:44.176 --> 34:47.257
Yesterday in front of Bofeng,
it was he who came to our rescue.

34:47.257 --> 34:50.417
I feared he'd be hunted by the Heihu Crew,
so I let him take shelter here.

34:52.016 --> 34:53.616
So you saved our lives.

34:53.616 --> 34:54.897
Forgive me, young master.

34:54.897 --> 34:57.297
Yesterday, I left in a hurry
and didn't see you clearly.

34:57.297 --> 35:00.737
You are handsome,

35:00.737 --> 35:03.417
an elegantly dressed gentleman,

35:03.417 --> 35:04.656
with an extraordinary bearing!

35:04.656 --> 35:08.096
Fu Zhi, he knows I'm not Situ Xue.

35:11.337 --> 35:12.817
You saved us, but you can't be alive!

35:12.817 --> 35:14.777
Meng pretended to be Situ Xue for my sake.

35:14.777 --> 35:16.056
And I'm the boss of Bofeng.

35:16.056 --> 35:18.176
Since you already know our secret,

35:18.176 --> 35:20.056
you can't live. Prepare to die!

35:22.457 --> 35:25.937
No wonder you're good friends.
You have the same temper.

35:29.857 --> 35:31.418
Meng!

35:31.418 --> 35:34.417
You want to make money
by impersonating Situ Xue, right?

35:34.417 --> 35:36.977
Let me teach Miss Meng
how to do it more convincingly.

35:38.216 --> 35:41.257
Situ Xue was born in March
and loves crabapple blossoms.

35:45.777 --> 35:47.176
With this crabapple flower,

35:50.457 --> 35:52.377
Miss Meng will be Situ Xue.

36:04.216 --> 36:06.897
I didn't expect you to know Situ Xue.

36:06.897 --> 36:08.457
What a pleasant surprise!

36:08.457 --> 36:09.737
You two can be friends.

36:09.737 --> 36:10.937
- No way!
- No way!

36:14.257 --> 36:17.457
But friends also settle accounts clearly.

36:18.697 --> 36:19.697
Yesterday's lodging fee,

36:19.697 --> 36:20.737
today's get-scared fee,

36:20.737 --> 36:22.417
wall repair fee,

36:22.417 --> 36:24.216
- and medical expenses...
- Both hands.

36:24.216 --> 36:25.337
Altogether,

36:25.337 --> 36:27.297
three times the room rate, payable in cash.

36:30.576 --> 36:33.377
Young master,
are you trying to skip out on the bill?

36:39.457 --> 36:42.257
The jade is translucent
and warms to the touch.

36:43.297 --> 36:44.496
Good jade.

36:44.496 --> 36:45.696
How should I address you, young master?

36:45.696 --> 36:46.777
He Du.

36:46.777 --> 36:49.337
I'll leave this jade pendant
as collateral with you for now.

36:49.337 --> 36:51.576
Once my friend arrives,
I'll pay the full amount.

36:52.216 --> 36:53.216
Alright, good.

36:53.216 --> 36:55.337
With this jade pendant, you can stay forever.

36:55.337 --> 36:57.297
No, I'm taking you away today.

36:59.696 --> 37:01.616
If there's nothing else, you may leave now.

37:02.536 --> 37:03.536
Sure.

37:05.817 --> 37:07.977
Fu Zhi, he must be sent away.

37:08.696 --> 37:11.257
For the sake of the jade pendant,
just let it go.

37:11.257 --> 37:13.216
His pendant is worth
at least ten houses in Shazhou.

37:13.216 --> 37:14.778
He doesn't seem ordinary and is so showy.

37:14.778 --> 37:17.137
Sooner or later,
he'll bring trouble to Bofeng. He must leave.

37:17.137 --> 37:18.297
I also need to get my dossier back.

37:18.297 --> 37:19.297
Your dossier?

37:20.938 --> 37:21.938
Come take a look.

37:21.938 --> 37:23.337
Come take a look.

37:24.176 --> 37:27.176
Miss Meng, these are newly acquired books.

37:27.176 --> 37:28.257
I saved them especially for you.

37:31.897 --> 37:32.897
Thank you, sir.

37:32.897 --> 37:35.937
You're welcome. Come again.

37:41.536 --> 37:43.457
<i>Black leather boots,
belt for military officers,</i>

37:43.457 --> 37:44.977
<i>and long sword.</i>

37:44.977 --> 37:46.696
<i>They must be military officers
from the capital.</i>

37:50.337 --> 37:53.817
Find him! Check every corner!

37:53.817 --> 37:54.817
Search!

38:11.696 --> 38:12.817
Sir, look!

38:14.304 --> 38:17.662
[I saw this person at Guxiang Street
at the hour of Chen]

38:20.016 --> 38:21.016
Move!

38:33.056 --> 38:35.056
Mr. He, we need to hurry,

38:35.977 --> 38:37.737
or we'll miss the opening of Jiuyou City.

38:39.897 --> 38:41.496
Meng Ting Hui.

38:44.257 --> 38:47.016
Where did you hook another rich young master?

38:47.016 --> 38:48.696
Good for you.

38:48.696 --> 38:51.777
No man wants an orphan girl,

38:51.777 --> 38:54.097
yet you actually landed a rich man.

38:54.097 --> 38:57.737
Not everyone relies on marriage
to change their fate like you.

38:58.377 --> 39:00.737
You want to change it, but you can't, right?

39:00.737 --> 39:02.616
I heard you offended Jiang Mei Er.

39:02.616 --> 39:04.577
Just give up on the Imperial Examination now.

39:04.577 --> 39:07.216
All these years, you've been deceiving Fu Zhi

39:07.216 --> 39:09.576
to get free food and shelter from our family.

39:09.576 --> 39:11.536
Otherwise,
you'd have ended up in the streets.

39:11.536 --> 39:13.337
Mrs. Yan, watch your words.

39:13.337 --> 39:15.056
I work and study at the women's academy.

39:15.056 --> 39:17.096
I've never taken advantage of the Yan family.

39:17.096 --> 39:18.656
Unlike you, Mrs. Yan.

39:18.656 --> 39:19.777
Nice silk

39:19.777 --> 39:21.377
and jewels.

39:21.377 --> 39:24.616
The Yan family's accounts
probably can't withstand a close inspection.

39:24.616 --> 39:26.696
You can turn black into white.

39:26.696 --> 39:28.937
You've been surviving by deception
since childhood.

39:28.937 --> 39:30.616
And you're always scheming.

39:30.616 --> 39:32.977
No wonder Fu Zhi treats you so well.

39:34.536 --> 39:36.576
Mr. Yan, you're here.

39:36.576 --> 39:37.817
My dear!

39:38.857 --> 39:39.937
My dear.

39:41.096 --> 39:43.377
You say I'm good at scheming?

39:43.377 --> 39:45.857
Your ability to change faces
is even more brilliant.

39:50.216 --> 39:52.536
Young master,
you have an extraordinary bearing.

39:52.536 --> 39:53.777
Just a reminder for you.

39:54.417 --> 39:56.457
Stay away from this bad girl.

39:56.457 --> 39:58.977
She will kill for money.

39:58.977 --> 40:02.496
When I was pregnant,
she pushed me down the stairs.

40:02.496 --> 40:04.817
She is quite vicious for a young girl.

40:17.536 --> 40:18.897
It's not too late to leave now.

40:19.897 --> 40:22.496
Miss Meng,
you're getting more and more interesting.

40:22.496 --> 40:24.096
Aren't we going to Jiuyou City?

40:24.737 --> 40:26.817
I already gave you a chance.

40:26.817 --> 40:29.216
If you're not leaving, then sorry.

41:03.656 --> 41:05.337
Meng Ting Hui really surprised me.

41:06.176 --> 41:08.496
She even gathered all of you together.

41:08.496 --> 41:11.016
[Bingjianzi: meaning friends, brothers]
Bingjianzi, where are you from?

41:11.016 --> 41:13.016
Let's not mistake each other.

41:13.016 --> 41:14.696
This guy is not easy to deal with.

41:14.696 --> 41:17.496
Let's cooperate and take out his legs.

41:45.016 --> 41:46.297
- Spare me, sir!
- Spare me, sir!

41:46.297 --> 41:48.897
- We won't do it again!
- We won't do it again!

41:48.897 --> 41:50.857
- Spare me, sir!
- Spare me, sir!

41:52.257 --> 41:53.297
We won't do it again! Spare us!

41:53.297 --> 41:55.257
- Spare me, sir!
- Spare me, sir!

42:10.696 --> 42:13.656
Where did you get this military knife?
